  the build stages only and is not part of the serving image.

Model files (downloaded from Hugging Face by scripts/prepare.sh; not included in this repository or its image)
  nvidia/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-FP4-Local is NVIDIA's FP4 checkpoint of Qwen/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next. Per its model card, its
  use is governed by the NVIDIA Open Model Agreement
  (https://www.nvidia.com/en-us/agreements/enterprise-software/nvidia-open-model-agreement/), with the Qwen Community
  License 1.0 (https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next/blob/main/LICENSE) for the base model.
  turboderp/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-exl3 (branch 2.68bpw_h6_ng8) is turboderp's EXL3 quantization of Qwen3.8-Flash-Next,
  under the Qwen Community License 1.0 per its model card and LICENSE file. Only its routed-expert tensors are used,
  re-laid-out per rank, unmodified.

